: 401, "parameters": ["It's so good to finally meet you. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I've heard a lot about you from "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["my kouhai."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Male Facesets 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Y-you have?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hai. We're always happy to welcome "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["new miko into the shrine. I think you'll "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["be very happy here."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Male Facesets 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I thought so too...but I'm starting "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to have second thoughts."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Thats completely understandable. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["It's a big step, and a big change."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["But just know that everyone here "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["knows what it's like."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["So, to start with. What's your name?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Male Facesets 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Uh, James. But I thought you knew "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["that..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ah ah. That's not the name of a miko "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["is it?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Male Facesets 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Oh, right. But what should I call "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["myself?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 102, "parameters": [["It's up to you.", "You will be..."], 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [0, ["It's up to you.", "You will be..."]]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 122, "parameters": [144, 144, 1, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Male Facesets 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Up to me? Then I guess...Ayame."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["It's close to my old name."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["A beautiful name."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [1, "It's up to you."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ayame."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Male Facesets 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Really? Doesn't that sound too close "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to my old name?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Does it? What was your old name again?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Male Facesets 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ayame. No, that's...it was Ayame?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You only need one name here."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 404, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Victorian Girl Face", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Now come along Ayame. We need to get "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you dressed in your uniform."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [-1, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait